#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:5 0552fd97c6dd48e8af7d9d54a38ef335
msgid "ROS 2 on Raspberry Pi"
msgstr "在 Raspberry Pi 上使用 ROS 2"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:7 a093e8bcf4a345c6a94a2a8fc76173fc
msgid ""
"ROS2 (via DDS) is not part of the standard ArduPilot build. Use the "
"`Custom Build Server <https://custom.ardupilot.org/add_build>`__ and "
"ensure \"MicroXRCE DDS support for ROS 2\" is checked."
msgstr ""
"ROS 2（通过 DDS）不属于 ArduPilot 标准构建的一部分。请使用 `自定义构建服务器 "
"<https://custom.ardupilot.org/add_build>`__ 并确保勾选「MicroXRCE DDS support "
"for ROS 2」。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:10 1be3c424a4db43079445b492eecaf783
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "目的"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:12 517ee4055ea344e99cbb23ae9a594fc9
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Learn how to install the ROS onto a companion computer and run a sample "
"ROS 2 application that communicated with ArduPilot over Micro XRCE DDS. "
"For this demonstration, a Raspberry Pi Zero 2W will be used, however "
"other Linux computers are also capable."
msgstr ""
"学习如何在伴飞计算机上安装 ROS，并运行一个通过 Micro XRCE DDS 与 ArduPilot 通信的 ROS 2 示例应用。本演示使用"
" Raspberry Pi Zero 2W，但其他 Linux 计算机同样适用。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:16 3e94b469b4de48a68b17fd4ae8d9ba2a
msgid "Required Hardware"
msgstr "所需硬件"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:18 668e94627f754a01b0860a7322e82f81
msgid ""
"`Raspberry Pi Zero 2W <https://www.raspberrypi.com/products/raspberry-pi-"
"zero-2-w/>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Raspberry Pi Zero 2W <https://www.raspberrypi.com/products/raspberry-pi-"
"zero-2-w/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:19 a3d0bbdbc9d84234875ec4eb0d282407
msgid "A Linux computer to flash an SD card and configure the Pi"
msgstr "一台 Linux 计算机，用于烧录 SD 卡并配置 Pi"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:22 fe81e56691f84c4fa2206c7e3c63c709
msgid "Initial Configuration"
msgstr "初始配置"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:24 d30f274341b74eb8a5b8b0e3ec04f55d
msgid ""
"For the first section, we will follow `Ubuntu's tutorial "
"<https://ubuntu.com/tutorials/how-to-install-ubuntu-on-your-raspberry-"
"pi#1-overview>`__ , with specifics noted below."
msgstr ""
"在第一部分，我们将遵循 `Ubuntu 的教程 <https://ubuntu.com/tutorials/how-to-install-"
"ubuntu-on-your-raspberry-pi#1-overview>`__，以下会列出具体细节。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:26 5d38ced69ad14c5cb89558f398998a69
msgid "Use ``rpi-imager``."
msgstr "使用 ``rpi-imager``。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:28 0c6ce7ea57064017966863984a948ac2
msgid ""
"When selecting the operating system, we will install Ubuntu 22 Server. "
"Find it in \"Other general-purpose OS -> Ubuntu -> Ubuntu Server 22.04.5 "
"LTS (64-bit) which is supported by `ROS 2 humble "
"<https://www.ros.org/reps/rep-2000.html#humble-hawksbill-"
"may-2022-may-2027>`__. When prompted to do \"OS Customisation\", select "
"that."
msgstr ""
"选择操作系统时，安装 Ubuntu 22 Server。在「Other general-purpose OS -> Ubuntu -> "
"Ubuntu Server 22.04.5 LTS (64-bit)」中找到它，该版本受 `ROS 2 Humble "
"<https://www.ros.org/reps/rep-2000.html#humble-hawksbill-"
"may-2022-may-2027>`__ 支持。当提示进行「OS Customisation」时，选择该选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:33 463b8bf3ca8a445d873397ba3ce4dc32
msgid "In \"General\", Configure wireless LAN"
msgstr "在「General」中配置无线局域网"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:34 d3ac9e14cec84340b189fc44c829bd98
msgid "In \"Services\", enable SSH"
msgstr "在「Services」中启用 SSH"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:35 367d24fd0f254da59f868a29115513ba
msgid "Save and flash the image onto the device"
msgstr "保存并将镜像烧录到设备"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:37 ed0dd3c2bbf64165a542e23739196e97
msgid ""
"Install the SD card, let it boot for 2 minutes, then either through a "
"HDMI display and keyboard, or by plugging the Pi's SD card back into your"
" computer, edit the file: ``/etc/avahi/avahi-daemon.conf`` and change the"
" line that has ``publish-workstation`` to ``publish-workstation=yes``."
msgstr ""
"插入 SD 卡，等待启动约 2 分钟，然后通过 HDMI 显示器和键盘，或将 Pi 的 SD 卡重新插入计算机，编辑文件 ``/etc/avahi"
"/avahi-daemon.conf``，将包含 ``publish-workstation`` 的行改为 ``publish-"
"workstation=yes``。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:40 7a3a8491c22543918b674df86b0f85ca
msgid ""
"Now, put the SD card back into the Pi, boot it up with the USB, and you "
"can now connect."
msgstr "现在，将 SD 卡放回 Pi，通过 USB 启动，即可进行连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:50 83f46d3834004a8f80ed439deec43f0a
msgid ""
"Once you SSH, create your username and password, and test you can still "
"login, it's time to set up ROS 2. We'll install all the packages before "
"it's wired into the drone."
msgstr "通过 SSH 连接后，创建用户名和密码，验证可以正常登录，然后开始设置 ROS 2。我们将在接线到无人机之前安装所有软件包。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:54 2b7968543df346b2b592d251c86c0ed0
msgid "ROS 2 Install"
msgstr "安装 ROS 2"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:56 ceee2b1be8fd498da36ca540e6130921
msgid ""
"When using Ubuntu 22.04, it's easiest to install ROS 2 through `binaries "
"<https://docs.ros.org/en/humble/Installation/Ubuntu-Install-Debs.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"在使用 Ubuntu 22.04 时，通过 `二进制包 <https://docs.ros.org/en/humble/Installation"
"/Ubuntu-Install-Debs.html>`_ 安装 ROS 2 最为方便。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:59 3cef7dcd38ad48b18d9be8248798aa3e
msgid ""
"First off, if you can't use ``apt update`` due to \"Waiting for cache "
"lock: Could not get lock /var/lib/dpkg/lock-frontend. It is held by "
"process 912 (unattended-upgr)\", try removing unattended upgrades"
msgstr ""
"首先，如果由于「Waiting for cache lock: Could not get lock /var/lib/dpkg/lock-"
"frontend. It is held by process 912 (unattended-upgr)」无法使用 ``apt "
"update``，请尝试删除自动升级包"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:67 f2408978d7954411a748c77cffed3e74
msgid ""
"When installing ROS 2, install ``ros-humble-ros-base`` and ``ros-dev-"
"tools``."
msgstr "安装 ROS 2 时，安装 ``ros-humble-ros-base`` 和 ``ros-dev-tools``。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:69 84089ed06f8f4ac7abbc8396a734dda2
msgid ""
"Finally, source the ROS environment automatically by adding it to your "
"``.bashrc``:"
msgstr "最后，通过将其添加到 ``.bashrc`` 来自动激活 ROS 环境："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:78 69188aa4a4254aa8acb100506927fb82
msgid "Finally, check you have the ROS 2 CLI:"
msgstr "最后，验证 ROS 2 CLI 可用："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:85 c9a3a3cee1a44bb6a104e1e88ab4d936
msgid "Serial Connection"
msgstr "串口连接"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:87 e4f034959f5744d690e89ef54c66ef8d
msgid ""
"Now, wire a serial connection to your flight controller. Ensure your "
"power supply is capable of powering the Pi Zero 2W. The simplest solution"
" is to wire an open telemetry port."
msgstr "现在，将串口连接到飞控。确保电源能够为 Pi Zero 2W 供电。最简单的方案是连接一个空闲的数传端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:92 1378d05415a0437389ac6276b105920e
msgid ""
"Do not abuse the power supply for the flight controller. For robust "
"applications, it is recommended to power non-flight-critical devices, "
"such as a Raspberry Pi, with a separate 5V power supply. Although many "
"flight controller power supplies may support the power draw of a "
"Raspberry Pi Zero 2W, a problem on the PI can bring down the entire "
"vehicle."
msgstr ""
"不要过度使用飞控的电源。对于可靠性要求高的应用，建议为非飞行关键设备（如 Raspberry Pi）使用独立的 5V "
"电源。虽然许多飞控电源可能能够为 Raspberry Pi Zero 2W 供电，但 Pi 出现问题可能导致整机失控。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:104 908fd2e2bfeb4a79a5ec6f48a7ed4bc6
msgid "This allow GPIO14 and GPIO15 (/dev/ttySO) to communicate with ArduPilot."
msgstr "这允许 GPIO14 和 GPIO15（/dev/ttySO）与 ArduPilot 通信。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:107 6a615ffcd761479e8a6deff003f81fa0
msgid "Cross Compile an application with Docker"
msgstr "使用 Docker 交叉编译应用程序"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:112 fa93fc9c94b64ce18b8a9d225c530b4f
msgid ""
"In order to run applications on a Raspberry Pi, we can cross compile them"
" for the ARM architecture. `Docker <https://www.docker.com/>`_ allows an "
"easy way to cross compile. Because of the Pi's limited memory, it is not "
"recommended to attempt compiling on target hardware. If you have a more "
"powerful computer, see the next section for direct compilation on ARM64."
msgstr ""
"为了在 Raspberry Pi 上运行应用程序，我们可以针对 ARM 架构进行交叉编译。`Docker "
"<https://www.docker.com/>`_ 提供了一种便捷的交叉编译方式。由于 Pi "
"的内存有限，不建议在目标硬件上直接编译。如果您有更强大的计算机，请参阅下一节了解在 ARM64 上直接编译的方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:117 d65425a1f86646398c01d9b38b1439a3
msgid "First, create a dockerfile like so on your laptop called ``Dockerfile``"
msgstr "首先，在您的笔记本电脑上创建名为 ``Dockerfile`` 的文件"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:140 b7743c5ed86b4feabbaa8a5296376d5a
msgid ""
"Next, use Docker's multi-platform build support to set up a cross compile"
" in an ARM64v8 environment: https://docs.docker.com/build/building/multi-"
"platform/#install-qemu-manually"
msgstr ""
"接下来，使用 Docker 的多平台构建支持在 ARM64v8 "
"环境中设置交叉编译：https://docs.docker.com/build/building/multi-platform/#install-"
"qemu-manually"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:147 4b4221f74f8c4327be275d855b99f038
msgid ""
"Now, the following steps build the docker image and copy the ROS 2 "
"install directory to the target."
msgstr "现在，通过以下步骤构建 Docker 镜像并将 ROS 2 安装目录复制到目标设备。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:164 6264c11a6d9549c7bb1b6ef66e091788
msgid "Installing Dependencies"
msgstr "安装依赖项"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:166 08a7d7bd132042e5bec1cbc9c7708549
msgid ""
"Although we have copied the executable(s) over, the runtime dependencies "
"are not installed. Let's use rosdep to install those. The target only "
"needs runtime dependencies, which are denoted with tag ``exec``."
msgstr ""
"尽管我们已将可执行文件复制过去，但运行时依赖项尚未安装。我们使用 rosdep 安装这些依赖项。目标设备只需要运行时依赖项，以标签 "
"``exec`` 标识。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:170 03247ed521c04672b43b7555900ee679
msgid "After SSH'ing into the target, run:"
msgstr "SSH 连接到目标设备后，运行："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:181 b02627596ef8404cb818d6568304c08e
msgid "Compiling the Micro ROS agent directly on ARM64"
msgstr "在 ARM64 上直接编译 Micro ROS Agent"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:183 8eb8fb445dee4a2ea12d9472de86f54b
msgid ""
"Instead of cross compiling, some more powerful companion computers can "
"support local compilation."
msgstr "对于性能较强的伴飞计算机，可以不进行交叉编译，而是在本地直接编译。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:187 41a37745d3e945b3a5bac40f8bcc275a
msgid "Instructions coming soon"
msgstr "说明即将发布"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:190 4164d6b16a0e4cc98de1375527339f9e
msgid "Test the Micro ROS Agent"
msgstr "测试 Micro ROS Agent"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:192 8388fb997e5c45f7bfecfaf1dd3fbe6c
msgid ""
"Now that you have a cross-compiled installation of the Micro ROS Agent "
"along with its dependencies, let's check we can run it."
msgstr "现在您已经交叉编译并安装了 Micro ROS Agent 及其依赖项，让我们验证是否可以运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:200 5b19ace1032e493aa3e246c786fa8287
msgid "Starting the Micro ROS Agent automatically"
msgstr "自动启动 Micro ROS Agent"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:202 dd32e0ca6f6d4ec48eb73afc470bb120
msgid ""
"Rather than having to SSH into the companion computer and manually start "
"all ROS 2 nodes in terminal, let's use systemd to start the service "
"automatically on boot. For this tutorial, we will use systemd user "
"services because they do not require root to run."
msgstr ""
"与其每次通过 SSH 连接伴飞计算机并手动在终端启动所有 ROS 2 节点，不如使用 systemd 在启动时自动启动服务。本教程使用 "
"systemd 用户服务，因为它们不需要 root 权限运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:206 5abb513f60a24820a6260de0ee8f1afd
msgid ""
"First, create a script on the companion computer that sources the ROS 2 "
"workspace and runs the Micro ROS Agent."
msgstr "首先，在伴飞计算机上创建一个脚本，用于激活 ROS 2 工作空间并运行 Micro ROS Agent。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:213 5fa78cbb1a8d4cc1825880c0b1daa9b7
