msgid ""
"If you are not using ``ubuntu`` as your username, be sure to change the "
"``WorkingDirectory`` and ``ExecStart`` fields above!"
msgstr "如果您使用的用户名不是 ``ubuntu``，请务必修改上面的 ``WorkingDirectory`` 和 ``ExecStart`` 字段！"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:237 dc24d52566db49b3a05b3a8e22603889
msgid "Also, create the start script:"
msgstr "同时，创建启动脚本："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:244 86a6f279e08b44178e9cc948a398eb33
