msgstr "并将以下脚本内容写入文件："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:253 bff15e516fcb4363b6f815b20f177bea
msgid ""
"Finally, make it executable, reload services, and start the new Micro ROS"
" Agent systemd service."
msgstr "最后，赋予可执行权限，重新加载服务，并启动新的 Micro ROS Agent systemd 服务。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:263 6dff9973971847c6bb688a83a586c1d3
msgid ""
"The MicroROS agent should show it has started. It is now waiting on a "
"connection from the autopilot. Once the autopilot is configured for the "
"same baud rate as the Micro ROS Agent, it should connect."
msgstr "MicroROS Agent 应显示已启动，并等待飞控连接。一旦飞控配置了与 Micro ROS Agent 相同的波特率，即可建立连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:266 3b576bbd5180401d8d992f8b7c29df10
msgid ""
"Because systemctl user services won't start until someone logs in, enable"
" linger for login."
msgstr "由于 systemctl 用户服务在有人登录之前不会启动，请为登录启用 linger。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:272 d41b3134bfee41a1a501edd071d81f76
msgid "Once you start adding more service, you can check status like so:"
msgstr "添加更多服务后，可以通过以下方式检查状态："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:278 dd011f2b7cc74923a6f80f68e1c2987e
msgid "Now, reboot, and verify your systemd service is up."
msgstr "现在，重启设备，验证 systemd 服务是否正常运行。"

